3. Data

   The data are pseudonymised activity statistics from a real online community.
   Chat identifiers, chat titles and user identifiers have been replaced with
   synthetic values, and no message content, names or usernames are included.
   If you believe you have identified a person or a chat, stop processing the
   data and notify the copyright holder.

